https://github.com/intel/tpm2-tools/releases/tag/3.0-rc0

It will depend on the next tss 1.X release 1.3. Note that you CANNOT use
The tss 1.3-rc0 pre-release as its missing a required patch. You need to use
Tip of 1.X at the moment.
https://github.com/intel/tpm2-tss/tree/1.x

Version 1.1.1 of abrmd will continue to work:
https://github.com/intel/tpm2-abrmd/releases/tag/1.1.1

Please report any issues/patches you may have.

This is a big release.

